<translation id="6170145535196286635">Lapho isayithi icela ukulayisha kusengaphambili ngasese amalinki ekhasini layo, i-Thorium isebenzisa amaseva e-Google. Lokhu kufihla ubuwena kusayithi elayishwe ngaphambilini, kodwa i-Google ifunda ukuthi yimaphi amasayithi alayishwa ngaphambilini.</translation>
<translation id="469847031616755573">I-Thorium iyisiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="9121116283800901015">Mayelana ne-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="7557415942066581350">Uma ungena ngemvume kumasevisi eGoogle efana neGmail noma iYouTube nge-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />, ungangena ngemvume ngokuzenzakalela kuThorium nge-akhawunti efanayo</translation>
<translation id="8063674192889594521">Setha iphrofayela yakho entsha ye-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="2813532507332782105">Amathuluzi okuphepha e-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="5404516918685923379">Buyekeza izilawuli eziyinhloko zobumfihlo nokuvikeleka ku-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="391022854039785855">Ukuze usule idatha yopheqululo kule divayisi kuphela, kuyilapho uyigcina ku-Google Account yakho, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />phuma ngemvume ku-Thorium<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="232337676435179638">Ngokuvala lokhu, ungangena ngemvume kumasayithi e-Google njenge-Gmail ngaphandle kokungena ngemvume ku-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="3879276044795274924">Yenza i-Thorium ngokwezifiso</translation>
<translation id="6349701846617734224"><ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Ngamathuluzi avela ku-Thorium<ph name="END_LINK" />, ungabhrawuza ngokuphepha bese uhlala ulawula</translation>
<translation id="113825514187113500">Ku-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="2513495859821894442">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi akho kanye nokwengeziwe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuThorium</translation>
<translation id="1290370037980749495">I-Thorium iyashesha ukuqalisa futhi izathi ezisebenzisa i-JavaScript kufanele zisebenze njengoba ziklanyiwe (okunconywayo)</translation>
<translation id="3203458745325150724">IThorium Yakho</translation>
<translation id="3892055234200984404">Mayelana ne-&amp;Thorium</translation>
<translation id="8312332850957380094">Amanye amaphrofayela e-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="2823243626069255310">Yenza ngendlela oyifisayo iphrofayela yakho entsha ye-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="7057723382073894700">I-V8 iyi-JavaScript ye-Thorium futhi injini ye-WebAssembly isetshenziswe ukuthuthukisa ukusebenza kwesayithi</translation>
<translation id="9073817226409915222">Qhubeka usebenzise izinhlelo zokusebenza ezingemuva uma i-Thorium ivaliwe</translation>
<translation id="5737116114768420447">Phatha Amaphrofayela e-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="3390772469177266069">I-Thorium izokwazisa uma kukhona okudinga isibuyekezo sakho</translation>
<translation id="253414695030364725">I-Thorium ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi okungenzeka uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="1965458093883218976">Funda ukuthi i-Thorium ikugcina kanjani uphephile</translation>
<translation id="6097413908033623736">Siza i-Thorium ibengcono ngokubika <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />izilungiselelo zamanje<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="7153173282073382515">I-Thorium Incognito</translation>
<translation id="1861871537231630745">Ikuxwayisa mayelana namasayithi ayingozi, ngisho nalawo i-Google ebingazi ngawo ngaphambili, ngokuhlaziya idatha eningi evela kumasayithi kunokuvikela okujwayelekile. Ungakhetha ukweqa izixwayiso ze-Thorium.</translation>
<translation id="8182056223343645142">Phuma Ngemvume ku-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="4860412983011031251">Thola usizo nge-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="6079265919870015811">Faka iphrofayela yeThorium</translation>
<translation id="7473833913849364138">IThorium ilayisha ngaphambilini amakhasi okwenza ukubhrawuza nokusesha kusheshe. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana namakhasi okulayisha kuqala<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="898934820356659708">Uma futhi wabelana ngemibiko yokusetshenziswa kwe-Thorium, leyo mibiko ihlanganisa nama-URL owavakashelayo</translation>
<translation id="9072534646955460921">Ngamaphrofayela weThorium ungahlukanisa zonke izinto zakho zeThorium. Sungula amaphrofayela wabangane nomndeni, noma uhlukanise phakathi komsebenzi nobumnandi.</translation>
<translation id="4308905027810063387">Phuma ngemvume ku-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="6312135329022974196">Amanye Amaphrofayela e-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="8828163608353368128">Vumela ukungena ngemvume kwe-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="6497325017313227277">Susa kusuka  ku-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="8315496929814159292">Setha i-Thorium njengesiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="438883585792992435">IThorium ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina iThorium ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzekela uma ubuyela kuwo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana Nesilondolozi Senkumbulo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="1318664233874758685">I-Thorium ihlale ihlola ukuze iqinisekise ukuthi ibhrawuza inamasethingi aphephe kakhulu. Sizokwazisa uma kukhona okudinga ukubuyekezwa.</translation>
<translation id="4212981493728012253">Ukuvikela idatha lakho vumela i-Thorium isuse izimvume kumasayithi ongakawavakasheli muva nje. Ayizimisi izaziso.</translation>
<translation id="3224040524634124542">Uma uvumela amakhukhi, i-Thorium ingase iwasebenzise lapho ilayisha kusengaphambili</translation>
<translation id="1967056554017864811">Yenza ngokwezifiso iphrofayela yakho ye-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="682714496634566410">Qama iphrofayela lakho le-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="1927215335595997320">I-Thorium ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi engeziwe ongase uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha kakhudlwana lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="4344849281720725205">Uma futhi ulondoloza amabhukhimakhi ku-Google Account yakho, ungakwazi ukulandelela izintengo zomkhiqizo ku-Thorium futhi waziswe uma intengo yehla.</translation>
<translation id="2905944704289173754">Vumelanisa uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Thorium kumadivayisi akho wonkana</translation>
<translation id="7023976647734322618">Kwenze kube nzima kubantu abanokufinyelela kuthrafikhi yakho ye-inthanethi ukuze babone ukuthi imaphi amasayithi owavakashelayo. I-Thorium isebenzisa ukuxhuma okuvikelekile ukuze ibheke ikheli lasesizindeni se-inthanethi lesayithi ku-DNS (Isistimu Yokwetha Isizinda).</translation>
<translation id="3124765553592510724">Uma uthayipha ibha yekheli noma ibhokisi losesho, i-Thorium ithumela lokho okuthayiphayo kunjini yakho yosesho yokuzenzakalelayo ukuze uthole iziphakamiso ezingcono. Lokhu kuvaliwe ku-Incognito.</translation>
<translation id="5501994443630499490">Vula ukuvikela okwengeziwe ku-JavaScript ye-Thorium kanye nenjini ye-WebAssembly</translation>
<translation id="3597078885567529815"><ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />I-Thorium ikuxwayisa<ph name="END_LINK" /> mayelana namasayithi angaphephile kanye nokudawunilodiwe</translation>
<translation id="6539171476340543682">I-Thorium ingahlola amaphasiwedi akho lapho uwalondoloza khona</translation>
<translation id="5422284534340886571">Faka Iphrofayela yeThorium</translation>
<translation id="5346310914638900016">Phatha amaphrofayela e-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="2601544977861663592">Ngena ngemvume ku-Thorium</translation>
<translation id="4933700843989736491">Ngena ngemvume ku-Thorium uma ungena ngemvume kwamanye amasevisi e-Google</translation>
<translation id="7886351526956375471">Ubani osebenzisa i-Thorium?</translation>
